msgid ""
"A bare domain such as <em>example.com</em> matches that host only. Use "
"<em>*.example.com</em> to match its subdomains. Lines starting with "
"<em>#</em> are treated as comments."
msgstr ""
"Et råt domæne som <em>example.com</em> matcher kun host. Brug "
"<em>*.example.com</em> til at matche subdomæner. Linjer der starter med "
"<em>#</em> betragtes som kommentarer."

msgid "Accepted domains"
msgstr "Accepterede domæner"

msgid ""
"An iframe field that only renders an iframe when its URL is served by "
"one of the domains accepted for this field."
msgstr ""
"Et iframe felt som kun renderer en iframe hvis dens URL peger på et "
"af de domæner der er accepteret for dette felt."

msgid ""
"Embedded as an iframe only for: @domains. Any other URL is rendered as "
"a link."
msgstr ""
"Indlejres kun som iframe for: @domains. Alle andre URLer renderes som "
"links."

msgid "ITK"
msgstr "ITK"

msgid "Iframe (accepted domains)"
msgstr "Iframe (accepterede domæner)"

msgid ""
"No domains are accepted for this field yet, so every URL is rendered "
"as a link instead of an iframe."
msgstr ""
"Intet domæne er accepteret for dette felt endnu, så alle URLer renderes "
"som links istedet for iframes."

msgid ""
"One domain per line. Only URLs served by one of these domains are "
"rendered as an iframe; anything else renders nothing at all. As long "
"as the list is empty, no iframe is rendered."
msgstr ""
"Et domæne pr. linje. Kun URLer der peger på et af disse domæner "
"renderes som in iframe; andre domæner renderes ikke. Sålænge listen "
"er tom bliver ingen iframe renderet."

msgid "These lines are not valid domains: @domains"
msgstr "Disse linjger er ikke valide domæner: @domains"

msgid "Title, over iframe (accepted domains only)"
msgstr "Titel, over iframe (ved godkendte domæner)"

msgid "View in full screen"
msgstr "Vis i fuld skærm"

msgid ""
"Your browser does not support iframes, but you can visit <a "
"href=\":url\">@text</a>"
msgstr ""
"Din browser understøtter ikke iframes, men du kan besøge <a "
"href=\":url\">@text</a>"
